    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Whether you’re biking to the beach, gathering around the fire table at sunset, or enjoying slow mornings with coffee on one of six breezy balconies, this home creates the perfect setting for meaningful time together.<br><br>Thoughtfully designed for girls’ getaways and multi-generational family vacations, the layout offers both spacious gathering areas and private retreats. The separate carriage house provides an ideal escape for grandparents or friends wanting their own space, while the expansive open living room and oversized sectional make it effortless to reconnect after a day along scenic 30A.<br><br>✔ 5 Bedrooms/5 Bathrooms/Sleeps 16 comfortably<br>✔3-Story Main home+Private Carriage House (rare on 30A)<br>✔ Fully equipped kitchen w/quartz countertops & bfast bar<br>✔ Open living room w/oversized sectional, additional seating area & smart TV<br>✔ Fully stocked kitchen including 2 drip coffee makers & 2 keurigs<br>✔ Steps to Seacrest 12,000 sq. ft. Lagoon Pool<br>✔ Short walk or seasonal tram to beach access<br>✔ 6 porches + oversized back deck<br>✔ 5 adult bikes; 8 TVs<br>✔ Outdoor TV + fire table + grill + large dining table + comfy seating<br> ✔ 8 beach chairs, 2 umbrellas & beach towels<br>✔ Games, puzzles & Pack ’n Play<br>✔ Oversized back deck overlooks green space with corn hole<br>✔ Washer & dryer<br><br>Bedroom Layout:<br>* 1st Floor: Queen bedroom + full bath<br>* 2nd Floor: Two King master suites (one w/ twin bunk beds)<br>* 3rd Floor: Queen bed + 4 built-in twin XL bunks, private bath & wet bar<br>* Carriage House: King bedroom, kitchenette, living area & full bath<br><br>Everything has been thoughtfully curated so your group can arrive, settle in, and simply enjoy. Seacrest Beach is one of 30A’s most family-friendly communities—walkable, safe, and full of coastal charm!<br><br>You’ll be just minutes from:<br>🍹Peddlers Pavilion (boutiques, dining & live music)<br>🦀Rosemary Beach<br>☀️Alys Beach<br>🚲Local cafés & bike trails<br>🏝The Gulf’s iconic white-sand beaches<br><br>Important house guidelines to preserve the integrity and experience of this home:<br>• Minimum booking age: 25<br>• Primary renter must be present<br>• No smoking, pets, golf carts or parties<br>• No confetti, glitter, rose petals, or wall décor attachments<br><br>- Check-in: 4PM | Check-out: 10AM<br>- Required minimum age to book is 25 years of age<br>- 1 person per 2 persons under the age of 25 are required to be on site<br>- Primary renter must be present during stay<br><br>A $500 security hold is placed 2 days prior to arrival and released 7 days after departure if no damages are reported.<br>Legal photo ID and signed rental agreement required.<br>The extra guest fee covers neighborhood amenity access.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
